# Ask Polypus

**Skill:** `.cursor/skills/ask-polypus/SKILL.md` (MUST Read and follow when this rule loads).

## MUST

- Resolve `BASE` as `${POLYPUS_BASE_URL:-http://127.0.0.1:1320}`; probe `GET ${BASE}/health` before chat
- Call only that gateway OpenAI surface (`POST ${BASE}/v1/chat/completions`)
- Default model: `cf_local/@cf/google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it` when the user says Gemma / ask Polypus without another id
- Include the artifact under review in the prompt
- Synthesize the reply for the human; do not treat the consult as an implement order
- On health failure with non-loopback `BASE`, report remote unreachable; do not suggest local stack restart

## MUST NOT

- Call Cloudflare / LM Studio URLs directly from a consumer chat
- Start `bin/polypus` ad-hoc; when loopback health fails, MAY offer `make serve` in a Polypus checkout only
- Offer local `make serve` or consumer stack restart when `POLYPUS_BASE_URL` targets a remote host
- Use this rule for gateway ops (allow-lists, smoke, Switchyard); that is `polypus-operator` in the Polypus repo
